  "reasoning": "The defendant falsely represented that he was an authorized distributor of a product after the cooperation agreement had expired, induced the victim to pay 24,160 yuan, and failed to deliver the goods. This constitutes the use of false facts to obtain property, which is defined as fraud under Chinese criminal law. The subsequent refund and victim's forgiveness do not negate the criminal act. No other offenses (e.g., trademark infringement, illegal business) are indicated as primary charges in the provided examples.",
